after an error; the requirement is conditional on access\"\n        ],\n        \"parameters\": {}\n      },\n      \"operation_id\": \"49dd69ed2a0341d88e62bbd108a13636\",\n      \"previous_id\": null\n    }\n  ],\n  \"assessments\": [\n    {\n      \"direct_check_id\": \"e03e6ef66b114f65b7d0433efc2f26f6\",\n      \"experiment_check_id\": \"2f0f1d4acd0140a89420299dcb3e1288\",\n      \"raw_log\": \"/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-09-27_17-26-13-hashicorp_raft-real-run/logs/2f0f1d4acd0140a89420299dcb3e1288/stdout.log\",\n      \"blockers\": [\n        \"Direct oracle correspondence is unreviewed\"\n      ],\n      \"bounded_complete\": true,\n      \"confirmed\": false,\n      \"outcome\": \"violated\",\n      \"claim_id\": \"O_pipeline_response_order\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"units\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"unit-O_pipeline_response_order\",\n      \"candidate_id\": \"8873456b384a4c9d929091e2a05adc5d\",\n      \"obligation_ids\": [\n        \"O_pipeline_response_order\"\n      ],\n      \"binding_ids\": [\n        \"bind_pipeline_response\"\n      ],\n      \"relation_ids\": [],\n      \"scope\": {\n        \"description\": \"Local AppendFuture access contract in Raft.pipelineDecode for completed built-in pipeline futures. Measure call order with an observing forwarding wrapper; do not substitute a successful reply for a real failed RPC.\",\n        \"assumptions\": [\n          \"The wrapper delegates all methods and values to the actual future and records method entry/return only.\",\n          \"An isolated decoder context is sufficient for this method-access contract; no election or application history is inferred.\"\n        ],\n        \"excluded\": [\n          \"Whether invalid response bytes cause an unsafe commit\",\n          \"Global consensus safety\",\n          \"Crash recovery or liveness\",\n          \"A requirement to call Response after an error; the requirement is conditional on access\"\n        ],\n        \"parameters\": {}\n      },\n      \"rationale\": \"The selected discriminator established an explicit interface expectation and actual producer semantics. Register a bounded implementation-semantics obligation for same-future access ordering. This local check is directly grounded and cheaper than proving an unsafe network history; built-in completion ordering and follower failure guards are retained as contrary evidence against stronger consequences. After this bounded check, return to pipeline error reachability or membership/snapshot support depending on results.\",\n      \"status\": \"partial\",\n      \"previous_id\": null,\n      \"version\": 1,\n      \"boundary_changes\": [],\n      \"obligation_checks\": {\n        \"O_pipeline_response_order\": [\n          \"2f0f1d4acd0140a89420299dcb3e1288\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"remaining_obligation_ids\": [\n        \"O_pipeline_response_order\"\n      ],\n      \"recheck_reasons\": [],\n      \"semantic_readiness\": {},\n      \"coverage_limitations\": [\n        \"Bounded direct comparison completed; local attribution remains pending: Direct oracle correspondence is unreviewed\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"current\": {\n    \"phase\": \"executed\",\n    \"operation_id\": \"49dd69ed2a0341d88e62bbd108a13636\",\n    \"action\": \"check\",\n    \"direct_check_id\": \"e03e6ef66b114f65b7d0433efc2f26f6\"\n  }\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
